# ViT

Installable Vision Transformer package and CIFAR-10 training script.

## Install

```bash
pip install -e .
```

## Train

```bash
python scripts/train.py --data-dir ./cifar-10-python/cifar-10-batches-py
python scripts/train_imagenette.py
```

Useful flags: `--epochs`, `--batch-size`, `--lr`, `--weight-decay`, `--checkpoint-path`, `--runs-dir`.
